- `relative_price_position = our_bid / award_price` is the single most predictive feature in classical bidding literature; it is normalized, so bids of different sizes compare. (The `/ median bid` variant is only possible when all bids are known — for us that means `_4` participant-inspection captures; public sources publish the winner only, so v1 uses the winner/award price — round-4 §C2.)
